            "sha256": "a7edaa50f6ed5b70ea23fef3632fd2da31a2a09aa323fb8e4631e647ee35ebab",
            "start": 1806,
            "end": 1925,
            "quote": "**API 迁移提示：**PyTorch 2.4 将 `torch.cuda.amp.autocast` 标记为 deprecated，推荐使用 `torch.amp.autocast('cuda')`。两者用法完全一致，仅导入路径不同。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "call_00_UIj8hQleGlfPSl7WjgGn0087.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "a7edaa50f6ed5b70ea23fef3632fd2da31a2a09aa323fb8e4631e647ee35ebab",
            "start": 1292,
            "end": 1352,
            "quote": "GradScaler`：动态调整梯度缩放系数，放大 FP16 梯度以防止下溢（仅 FP16 需要，BF16 通常不需要）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "call_00_QZG4TS2WVTB1sPvsFmgc3468.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "034e60150f1e397613798110c713586e4b781c8b5e131f75912b3770ebf739e4",
            "start": 1377,
            "end": 1464,
            "quote": "`torch.cuda.amp.autocast(args...)` and `torch.cpu.amp.autocast(args...)` is deprecated.",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "5e5e0180912a95a2ddc1701f3a570699509ce3e75187a08884014c64991f74fa",
            "start": 1168,
            "end": 1249,
            "quote": "2.x 新统一接口：`torch.amp.autocast('cuda', dtype=...)`、`torch.amp.GradScaler('cuda')`。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "5e5e0180912a95a2ddc1701f3a570699509ce3e75187a08884014c64991f74fa",
            "start": 969,
            "end": 1054,
            "quote": "先 `scaler.unscale_(optimizer)` 再 `torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(...)`，否则裁剪的是被放大后的梯度。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "5e5e0180912a95a2ddc1701f3a570699509ce3e75187a08884014c64991f74fa",
            "start": 1253,
            "end": 1345,
            "quote": "不确定处：\\n1. `torch.cuda.amp.autocast` / `GradScaler` 在最新版（2.4/2.5+）是否已被标记 deprecated、以及确切推荐写法。",
            "json_escaped": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "57ea6845090912ff2d73f5c22211dafd5bb61feaad8a14af11b17185462992dd",
            "start": 5078,
            "end": 5190,
            "quote": "官方文档版本：抓取到的为 **PyTorch 2.14**（tutorials 页标注 “2.14.0+cu130 documentation”；amp API 页 “PyTorch 2.14 documentation”）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "57ea6845090912ff2d73f5c22211dafd5bb61feaad8a14af11b17185462992dd",
            "start": 5454,
            "end": 5556,
            "quote": "我没能逐一确认每个小版本（如 `torch.amp.GradScaler` 的 `device_type` 参数、`torch.autocast(device_type=...)` 形式）精确引入的版本号",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "57ea6845090912ff2d73f5c22211dafd5bb61feaad8a14af11b17185462992dd",
            "start": 1026,
            "end": 1220,
            "quote": "scaler = torch.amp.GradScaler(\"cuda\")   # 每个训练过程用一个新的 scaler\n\nfor inputs, targets in loader:\n    opt.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    with torch.autocast(device_type=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16):",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-22",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "57ea6845090912ff2d73f5c22211dafd5bb61feaad8a14af11b17185462992dd",
            "start": 2240,
            "end": 2336,
            "quote": "前置条件（recipe 原文）**：PyTorch 1.6 或更高、CUDA-capable GPU；Tensor Core 架构（Volta/Turing/Ampere）收益最大（2–3X）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-23",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "57ea6845090912ff2d73f5c22211dafd5bb61feaad8a14af11b17185462992dd",
            "start": 60,
            "end": 247,
            "quote": "官方明确：`torch.cuda.amp.autocast(args...)` 与 `torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler(args...)` **已废弃（deprecated）**，应改用统一接口 `torch.amp.autocast(\"cuda\", args...)` 和 `torch.amp.GradScaler(\"cuda\", args...)`。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
